  "unique_experiment_configurations": 28,
  "key_findings": [
    "Table 1 uses all cases from trained domains, tables 2 and 3 use accepted-ID Dice with ECE before filtering",
    "FWT is post-training per-case difference against Sequential at the same stage, not zero-shot forward transfer",
    "ECE implementation normalizes both case Dice and OoD scores and has a maximum-edge bin omission risk",
    "Double conditioning and reconstruction detection are not uniformly best, notably at HK",
    "Training known boundaries and task condition; test reconstruction minimizes over previous identities",
    "Paper VAE lr decay 0.99 versus code 0.999 with early stopping",
    "Removing skips and freezing require matched controls; resources not fully reported"
  ]
